  57b65325fe34 "locks: skip deadlock detection on FL_FILE_PVT locks"
  5d50ffd7c31d "locks: add new fcntl cmd values for handling file
               private locks" (the core: uapi values 36/37/38, the
               fcntl()/fcntl64() dispatch, the FL_OFDLCK owner override
               in fcntl_setlk/setlk64/getlk/getlk64, the release of the
               locks on the last close, the SELinux lock permission
               hook, the ARM OABI shim)
  90478939dce0 "locks: require that flock->l_pid be set to 0 for
               file-private locks"
  d7a06983a01a "locks: fix locks_mandatory_locked to respect
               file-private locks"
  29723adee118 "locks: make locks_mandatory_area check for file-private
